WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.022
Welcome to My Library.

00:00:02.122 --> 00:00:08.272
This is where every file you create across your revenue streams is kept, ready to download.

00:00:08.372 --> 00:00:11.738
First, choose your book at the top of the page.

00:00:11.838 --> 00:00:16.428
Selecting one title shows only the assets that belong to that book.

00:00:16.528 --> 00:00:20.902
Choose All books only when you want to see everything together.

00:00:21.002 --> 00:00:23.480
Next, pick how you want to browse.

00:00:23.580 --> 00:00:27.522
Marketing Packs gives you ready promotion kits for each stream.

00:00:27.622 --> 00:00:34.852
By node groups files by revenue stream, such as your email sequences, course bundles and workshop decks.

00:00:34.952 --> 00:00:41.702
By format lets you find every Word file, PDF, slide deck or course bundle quickly.

00:00:41.802 --> 00:00:45.432
To get a file, click its format button to download it.

00:00:45.532 --> 00:00:50.434
Use the small arrow to choose another format, such as Word or PDF.

00:00:50.534 --> 00:00:55.340
And where a stream has a live page, copy its public link to share it.

00:00:55.440 --> 00:01:00.606
Remember, downloading a file never sends an email or publishes anything.

00:01:00.706 --> 00:01:02.728
You stay in control.

00:01:02.828 --> 00:01:04.850
Authors Bureau.

00:01:04.950 --> 00:01:07.068
Your Story is Your LIFE.
